{"id":"n69119-1-9","stage":2,"title":"외식 · 在外用餐","scene":"餐饮与生活","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n69119-1-9-1","ko":"저녁에 외식으로 불고기 어때요?","zh":"晚上出去吃烤肉怎么样？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"저녁에","meaning":"晚饭，晚餐","explanation":"저녁：晚饭，晚餐；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"저녁","audio":"/audio/8d3c547011f433e6d259.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71220","senseId":"2","lemma":"저녁","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"외식으로","meaning":"在外用餐，外餐","explanation":"외식：在外用餐，外餐；으로：表示方向、方式、手段、材料、身份或原因等关系。","readings":[{"term":"외식","audio":"/audio/1bbd94acaee739271f6e.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"69119","senseId":"1","lemma":"외식","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"불고기","meaning":"烤牛肉，烤肉","explanation":"불고기：烤牛肉，烤肉","readings":[{"term":"불고기","audio":"/audio/0ac627c8cdeac727a9f0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"26848","senseId":"1","lemma":"불고기","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"어때요?","meaning":"怎么样","explanation":"어떻다：怎么样；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"어떻다","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"70482","senseId":"1","lemma":"어떻다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"8d3c547011f433e6","term":"저녁","zh":"晚饭，晚餐","audio":"/audio/8d3c547011f433e6d259.mp3","entryId":"71220","definition":"晚上吃的饭。","pronunciation":["저녁"]},{"id":"1bbd94acaee73927","term":"외식","zh":"在外用餐，外餐","audio":"/audio/1bbd94acaee739271f6e.mp3","entryId":"69119","definition":"在家外面就餐；或指那样的就餐。","pronunciation":["외ː식","웨ː식"]},{"id":"0ac627c8cdeac727","term":"불고기","zh":"烤牛肉，烤肉","audio":"/audio/0ac627c8cdeac727a9f0.mp3","entryId":"26848","definition":"韩国传统料理之一，切薄后加入作料烤制出来的猪肉或牛肉。","pronunciation":["불고기"]},{"id":"e0a8c114a77e0814","term":"어떻다","zh":"怎么样","audio":"/audio/e0a8c114a77e081454d1.mp3","entryId":"70482","definition":"想法、感觉、状态或境况等成为什么状况。","pronunciation":["어떠타"]}],"audio":"/audio/4bb22e0b0a67550579c3.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n69119-1-9-2","ko":"오늘은 소화가 잘 안 되어서 집에서 간단히 먹는 게 좋겠어요.","zh":"今天消化不太好，还是在家里简单吃点比较好。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"오늘은","meaning":"今天，今日","explanation":"오늘：今天，今日；은：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"오늘","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68206","senseId":"1","lemma":"오늘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"소화가","meaning":"消化","explanation":"소화：消化；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"소화","audio":"/audio/0ee9f8952a4fc208c3d7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15298","senseId":"1","lemma":"소화","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"잘","meaning":"好好地，顺利地","explanation":"잘：好好地，顺利地","readings":[{"term":"잘","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58939","senseId":"4","lemma":"잘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"안","meaning":"不","explanation":"안：不","readings":[{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71372","senseId":"1","lemma":"안","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"되어서","meaning":"变得，弄得","explanation":"되다：变得，弄得；어서：连接原因与结果，或前后相接的动作。","readings":[{"term":"되다","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89858","senseId":"16","lemma":"되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"집에서","meaning":"家","explanation":"집：家；에서：格助词，表示动作发生的地点或出发点。","readings":[{"term":"집","audio":"/audio/99cf116bb12cf1061e0b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71358","senseId":"3","lemma":"집","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"간단히","meaning":"简单地，简便地","explanation":"간단히：简单地，简便地","readings":[{"term":"간단히","audio":"/audio/f496a22a97668f1f9dbf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"16200","senseId":"2","lemma":"간단히","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"먹는","meaning":"吃","explanation":"먹다：吃；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"먹다","audio":"/audio/9639f892bdddb53fc055.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58272","senseId":"1","lemma":"먹다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"게","meaning":"表示对未发生事情的预测、推测或计划。","explanation":"것：表示对未发生事情的预测、推测或计划。；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"것","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62835","senseId":"6","lemma":"것","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"좋겠어요.","meaning":"行，可以","explanation":"좋다：行，可以；겠：表示意愿、推测或礼貌委婉，结合整句判断。；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"좋다","audio":"/audio/86d0464f1c6da40233cd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"79033","senseId":"12","lemma":"좋다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"3bc6235e1d18162f","term":"오늘","zh":"今天，今日","audio":"/audio/3bc6235e1d18162fb94c.mp3","entryId":"68206","definition":"现在正在度过的这一天。","pronunciation":["오늘"]},{"id":"0ee9f8952a4fc208","term":"소화","zh":"消化","audio":"/audio/0ee9f8952a4fc208c3d7.mp3","entryId":"15298","definition":"摄入的食物在腹中分解并被吸收为营养成分。","pronunciation":["소화"]},{"id":"8aff11a4aebdccdb","term":"잘","zh":"好好地，顺利地","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3","entryId":"58939","definition":"没有任何问题而舒服地。","pronunciation":["잘"]},{"id":"bc00bc8172c83d5f","term":"안","zh":"不","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3","entryId":"71372","definition":"表示否定或反对。","pronunciation":["안"]},{"id":"91b4dc2748cba787","term":"되다","zh":"变得，弄得","audio":"/audio/91b4dc2748cba787dd6f.mp3","entryId":"89858","definition":"达到某种情况或状态。","pronunciation":["되다","뒈다"]},{"id":"99cf116bb12cf106","term":"집","zh":"家","audio":"/audio/99cf116bb12cf1061e0b.mp3","entryId":"71358","definition":"组成家庭而生活的一家子。","pronunciation":["집"]},{"id":"f496a22a97668f1f","term":"간단히","zh":"简单地，简便地","audio":"/audio/f496a22a97668f1f9dbf.mp3","entryId":"16200","definition":"不繁琐或不多地。","pronunciation":["간단히"]},{"id":"9639f892bdddb53f","term":"먹다","zh":"吃","audio":"/audio/9639f892bdddb53fc055.mp3","entryId":"58272","definition":"将食物送进口中并咽下。","pronunciation":["먹따"]},{"id":"1443a6c090b12228","term":"것","zh":"表示对未发生事情的预测、推测或计划。","audio":"/audio/1443a6c090b122289ad7.mp3","entryId":"62835","definition":"表示对未发生事情的预测、推测或计划。","pronunciation":["걷"]},{"id":"86d04